From f3c1043aedc3754ac315e79481857d59a3b7463e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nieyin345 <nieyin0703@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:52:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(docs): the reshell gate asked "who am I", not "who is
 running me"

The guard was `if (window.desktop)`. `desktop` is docs' own preload namespace
(preload/index.ts:284 exposes it unconditionally), so the condition is true in
standalone GenOffice too, and the 0014 promise -- "standalone GenOffice keeps
its own Word visual" -- never held. Measured in real Electron: standalone docs
loads mcode-theme-*.css into document.styleSheets.

The UA product token asks the right question. Mcode's main process calls
app.setName("Mcode") before whenReady (apps/desktop/src/main/index.ts:101), so
navigator.userAgent carries Mcode/. The vendor's own entry keeps its own name.
Same build artifact, two app names, only the gate differs.

Verified by apps/desktop/scripts/o8-docs-theme-gate-smoke (23 assertions, real
Electron, two runs differing only in app.setName):

  before the fix   11/17  -- standalone loaded mcode-theme, --surface was #fcfcfb
  after the fix    23/23

Four mutations, each checked against a predicted red count:
  M1 back to window.desktop     14/19 -- 5 red on the standalone side
  M3 gate hard-coded false      14/19 -- 5 red on the hosted side (1a/1b/1c/1d)
  M4 remove the getTheme call   21/23 -- 11b/11c name getTheme as missing

M4 matters most: before I strengthened the suite it was green. The first
version counted calls the probe itself made, so "the probe can reach getTheme"
was being reported as "the page called it". The fix is 11b (method names in
source) plus 11c (form-independent call set), with a control that feeds a
replaced sample to the same predicate to prove it reports a gap.

Also: 126 other window.desktop uses stay put. Those ask "does this namespace
have this capability", which is true standalone too. Section 4 of the card
records why replacing them would kill docs' AI panel, theme and author name.
---
 apps/docs/src/renderer/main.tsx | 17 +++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/apps/docs/src/renderer/main.tsx b/apps/docs/src/renderer/main.tsx
index 0538a98..690f7c9 100644
--- a/apps/docs/src/renderer/main.tsx
+++ b/apps/docs/src/renderer/main.tsx
@@ -19,11 +19,20 @@ import '@genoffice/ui/image-viewer.css'
 import './styles.css'
 import './fonts/fonts.css'
 // 【T39】Mcode 宿主主题层：把 GenOffice 的语义 token 重指到 Mcode 的 CDS 色阶。
-// **只在 Mcode 里加载** —— GenOffice 独立运行时没有 `window.desktop`,应当保持自己的
-// Word 视觉语言。运行时判断而不是构建期切分,是因为同一个构建产物两边共用(宿主按
-// pinned HEAD 重建 vendor,不另出一份「Mcode 版」)。
+// **只在 Mcode 里加载** —— GenOffice 独立运行时应当保持自己的 Word 视觉语言。
+// 运行时判断而不是构建期切分,是因为同一个构建产物两边共用(宿主按 pinned HEAD 重建
+// vendor,不另出一份「Mcode 版」)。
 // 放在 `styles.css` 之后:token 是自定义属性,后者先定义、这里覆盖,顺序决定胜负。
-if (window.desktop) import('./mcode-theme.css')
+//
+// 【O8 2026-10-24】**原来的守卫是 `if (window.desktop)`,它从来没起作用** ——
+// `desktop` 是 docs 自己的 preload 命名空间(`preload/index.ts:284` 无条件
+// `exposeInMainWorld('desktop', api)`),独立运行时也存在,所以这个 if 恒真。
+// 真 Electron 实测:独立 docs 的 `styleSheets` 里确实有 `mcode-theme-*.css`。
+// `window.desktop` 问的是「我是谁」,而这里要问的是「**谁在跑我**」—— UA 里的
+// `app.getName()` 产品号是那个答案(Mcode 主进程 `apps/desktop/src/main/index.ts`
+// 在 whenReady 之前 `app.setName("Mcode")`;vendor 独立入口用自己的名字)。
+// 判据见 `apps/desktop/scripts/o8-docs-theme-gate-smoke/`。
+if (/\bMcode\//.test(navigator.userAgent)) import('./mcode-theme.css')
 import { applyAiPanelPrefs, installScreenTips } from '@genoffice/ui'
 import { setAltChunkHtmlConverter } from '@genoffice/docx-engine'
 
-- 
